Data
----------------------------------------------------------------------------

The Chicago census geography and configuration vendored in
tasks/organization/chicago_segregation/legacy/ are not covered by the Apache
License of this repository. See
tasks/organization/chicago_segregation/legacy/DATA_LICENSE.md for the full
terms. In short:

  - U.S. Census Bureau: 2010 Census SF1, 2000 Census SF1/SF3, ACS 2008-2012,
    TIGER/Line boundaries. Public domain. This product uses the Census Bureau
    Data API but is not endorsed or certified by the Census Bureau.
  - City of Chicago Data Portal (https://data.cityofchicago.org): community
    areas, socioeconomic indicators, crime, CTA, schools, police, fire and
    parks. Used under the City of Chicago data Terms of Use; data provided by
    the City of Chicago Data Portal.
  - OpenStreetMap: the religious_places column. Map data (c) OpenStreetMap
    contributors, available under the Open Database License 1.0 (ODbL).
  - Mapping Inequality census crosswalk
    (https://github.com/americanpanorama/mapping-inequality-census-crosswalk;
